{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/60", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-2.json", "sha256": "2b4990cac121720f1b2489f96eac49d858e01979ceb72458191dccae5e646f7f"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Summary\n- `/n^{-s}` → `/n^{s}` for `2^ω` and `μ²` LSeries.term blueprints; fix `(f(m)/n^s)` sketch typo.\n- `pow_divisors_mul` (and injective / Möbius proof sketch) described perfect powers; Lean filters `x^k ∣ n`.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Blueprint text matches Lean statements"}], "id": "pr-1641", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "cbce0f549152d5bc8bf55943cc72da5a30aae3ee3e7ede88c9299f1838bb6cdc", "project_id": "ik-pow-divisors-text-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "ArithmeticFunction.pow_divisors_mul", "source_commit": "657ac0e5cf42c45b03b93a662fd8237b6b0be49f", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "13e578444fd36104966859694439209f2e80cbd15a39f9d6565dee766a378f01", "project_id": "ik-pow-divisors-text-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "ArithmeticFunction.pow_divisors_mul", "source_commit": "657ac0e5cf42c45b03b93a662fd8237b6b0be49f", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "c5e2f67c469c2d41da2af405543ba21d54c6a2580354c5ff274bf2cbb5452ae7", "project_id": "ik-pow-injective-text-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "ArithmeticFunction.pow_divisors_mul_injective", "source_commit": "657ac0e5cf42c45b03b93a662fd8237b6b0be49f", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "0249ad3e92a2f69ee00deb35f8a1190d74c14edb6b1007b6944392a7704bb3d9", "project_id": "ik-pow-injective-text-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", 