{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/59", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-2.json", "sha256": "2b4990cac121720f1b2489f96eac49d858e01979ceb72458191dccae5e646f7f"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Summary\n- Blueprint for `Eπ` said `/Li(x)`; Lean (and FKS2 usage) is `/(x/log x)`.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Blueprint matches `Defs.Eπ`"}], "id": "pr-1642", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "cbd07af46bebb399219a5539efd4ec7e96f3f583fce67b66e1d0e92781269de8", "project_id": "error-pi-text-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Eπ", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "333707c2a20f60b0e7ce3c52b38ab5e865bef05543417037d478fe473368150c", "project_id": "error-pi-text-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Eπ", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}], "schema_version": "paperlean-upstream-evidence-1", "source": {"author": "chessing234", "kind": "pr", "repository": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd", "title": "fix: Eπ blueprint uses x/log x, matching Lean", "url": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/pull/1642"}, "truth_status": "unverified_upstream_claim", "usable_as_scoring_label": false}
{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/57", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-2.json", "sha256": "2b4990cac121720f1b2489f96eac49d858e01979ceb72458191dccae5e646f7f"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Summary\n- `x ^ (p/q)` was picking Nat exponents, so `(3/2) → 1` and `(1/4),(3/5),… → 0`.\n- Annotate as `((n : ℝ) / m)` in Defs vinogradov bounds, FKS2 `table7`, FKS lemmas 5.2/5.3, Trudgian Thm 2, and KLN `J`.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Spot-check that affected statements match blueprint fractional powers"}], "id": "pr-1644", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "718b37f871ae5279cce828ee8d2824461839b64c381a9ac7a3747304f0aca50a", "project_id": "vinogradov-pi-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Eπ.vinogradovBound", "source_commit": "657ac0e5cf42c45b03b93a662fd8237b6b0be49f", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "e2247f7c40f816048c8839dbb97e7b62d67f8a21059c2e07a76ff87391ceecc4", "project_id": "vinogradov-pi-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Eπ.vinogradovBound", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "d213d1f687a3a64474fdf8974113b83d804cd77043832db79cbd282cca7dd4b8", "project_id": "vinogradov-pi-star-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Eπ_star.vinogradovBound", "source_commit": "657ac0e5cf42c45b03b93a662fd8237b6b0be49f", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "e77a0a896a97726011ff9cd03df0d44675cd051ac20e20c6d31eb3ec78b28194", "project_id": "vinogradov-pi-star-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Eπ_star.vinogradovBound", "source_commit