{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/53", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-2.json", "sha256": "2b4990cac121720f1b2489f96eac49d858e01979ceb72458191dccae5e646f7f"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Summary\n- Classical zero-free region: $\\Re(s)\\ge 1-1/(R\\log|t|)$, matching Lean.\n- Riemann–von Mangoldt: restore the absolute value around the main term.\n- Zero-density bound: drop the pasted RvM fragment; state the $N(\\sigma,T)$ estimate.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Diff blueprints against the Lean defs in `ZetaDefinitions.lean`"}], "id": "pr-1648", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "a90f3e5f0b4614bddbbb10f8724851a311cfc6cf367f6ca30975662cbd48e874", "project_id": "classical-zero-free-text-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "riemannZeta.classicalZeroFree", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "ea41ea98b29e1a326bcacba2bce2997ef2de9a49c14ad2bfdb7d7b38a931af44", "project_id": "classical-zero-free-text-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "riemannZeta.classicalZeroFree", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "952cf78469814d5a6c20d614bb505f27782f16c8d8a0694bf1b7704760131768", "project_id": "riemann-von-mangoldt-text-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "riemannZeta.Riemann_vonMangoldt_bound", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "d06e781d2475cc061c203455c82c8d55b4f94af0cd73810cac22ea308c6ceed3", "project_id": "riemann-von-mangoldt-text-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "riemannZeta.Riemann_vonMangoldt_bound", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "9415393142e202b06be56e29c8e52995f81ef1094cda40cb5a20e9f06dfeaa8e", "project_id": "zero-density-text-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "zero_density_bound", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "554a3ec7ce2623d137634a97764f73f1c15f705a15002a521f4e71534cd457f6", "project_id": "zero-density-text-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "zero_density_bound", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}], "schema_version": "paperlean-upstream-evidence-1", "source": {"author": "chessing234", "kind": "pr", "repository": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd", "title": "fix: classical ZFR, RvM, and ZDB blueprint statements", "url": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/pull/1648"}, "truth_status": "unverified_upstream_claim", "usable_as_scoring_label": false}
{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/43", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-2.json", "sha256": "2b4990cac121720f1b2489f96eac49d858e01979ceb72458191dccae5e646f7f"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Summary\n- Replace the $\\Lambda(n)/n$ sum with Büthe’s $\\pi^*(x)=\\sum_k\\pi(x^{1/k})/k$.\n- Aligns `Eπ_star` with the intended comparison function.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Check arXiv:1511.02032 (1.4) and `Buthe.pi_star`"}], "id": "pr-1658", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "1bb1dc0f40e000d75a8875554a5d0ed3c8e6d8918a6df186ee6eb9b141ae3777", "project_id": "pi-star-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "pi_star", "source_commit": "657ac0e5cf42c45b03b93a662fd8237b6b0be49f", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "4e1725dfed6c8a6d9422a870fde9f2bd42116fdd97c640ac5952ea63a795131d", "project_id": "pi-star-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "pi_star", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}], "schema_version": "paperlean-upstream-evidence-1", "source": {"author": "chessing234", "kind": "pr", "repository": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd", "title": "fix: π* is ∑ π(x^{1/k})/k", "url": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/pull/1658"}, "truth_status": "unverified_upstream_claim", "usable_as_scoring_label": false}
{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/75", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-2.json", "sha256": "2b4990cac121720f1b2489f96eac49d858e01979ceb72458191dccae5e646f7f"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Summary\n- `LSeries_totient_eq` only assumed `1 < Re(s)`, but the totient Dirichlet series converges absolutely only for `Re(s) > 2`.\n\n## Root cause\nIn the strip `1 < Re(s) ≤ 2` the L-series need not converge absolutely, so the Euler product identity is false as stated.\n\n## Fix\nStrengthen the hypothesis to `2 < s.re`, matching IK (1.35).\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] `lake build PrimeNumberTheoremAnd.IwaniecKowalskiCh1`\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)"}], "id": "pr-1626", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "783da9de469c1c7b1da9fa330690d3a736c58f8c530e6bf9818cb9dbdb042e1d", "project_id": "ik-totient-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "ArithmeticFunction.LSeries_totient_eq", "source_commit": "99d4ce46962a09b4ed95574e95c62b491673a1ad", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "1aef1f2092349a7e22fafc502f992db10765a1bb308e07adaed36a93ccbd323d", "project_id": "ik-totient-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "ArithmeticFunction.LSeries_totient_eq", "source_commit": "657ac0e5cf42c45b03b93a662fd8237b6b0be49f", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}], "schema_version": "paperlean-upstream-evidence-1", "source": {"author": "chessing234", "kind": "pr", "repository": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd", "title": "fix: require Re(s) > 2 in LSeries_totient_eq", "url": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/pull/1626"}, "truth_status": "unverified_upstream_claim", "usable_as_scoring_label": false}
{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/69", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-2.json", "sha256": "2b4990cac121720f1b2489f96eac49d858e01979ceb72458191dccae5e646f7f"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Summary\n- `LSeries_liouville_eq` now uses `↗liouville`, matching `↗τ`, `↗totient`, etc.\n- `zeta_pow_two` blueprint states `Re(s) > 1`, consistent with the Lean hypothesis.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] `lake build PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/IwaniecKowalskiCh1.lean`\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)"}], "id": "pr-1632", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "b840e1de72e7e7c1d3ab10abbb452b5143b6dace7133405c71b73a093198970c", "project_id": "ik-liouville-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "ArithmeticFunction.LSeries_liouville_eq", "source_commit": "99d4ce46962a09b4ed95574e95c62b491673a1ad", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "29eba7a95f8f3134299c8c6287b7702610ad4fe30238b070cc6461887081808a", "project_id": "ik-liouville-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "ArithmeticFunction.LSeries_liouville_eq", "source_commit": "657ac0e5cf42c45b03b93a662fd8237b6b0be49f", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}], "schema_version": "paperlean-upstream-evidence-1", "source": {"author": "chessing234", "kind": "pr", "repository": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd", "title": "fix: ↗liouville in LSeries_liouville_eq and Re(s) > 1 in zeta_pow_two blueprint", "url": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/pull/1632"}, "truth_status": "unverified_upstream_claim", "usable_as_scoring_label": false}
{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/41", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-2.json", "sha256": "2b4990cac121720f1b2489f96eac49d858e01979ceb72458191dccae5e646f7f"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Summary\n- Blueprint proof had $(1-p^{-s})^{-1}(1-p^{-2s})$; needs $(1-p^{-s})(1-p^{-2s})^{-1}$.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Check against $\\zeta(2s)/\\zeta(s)=\\prod(1+p^{-s})^{-1}$"}], "id": "pr-1660", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "b840e1de72e7e7c1d3ab10abbb452b5143b6dace7133405c71b73a093198970c", "project_id": "ik-liouville-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "ArithmeticFunction.LSeries_liouville_eq", "source_commit": "99d4ce46962a09b4ed95574e95c62b491673a1ad", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "29eba7a95f8f3134299c8c6287b7702610ad4fe30238b070cc6461887081808a", "project_id": "ik-liouville-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "ArithmeticFunction.LSeries_liouville_eq", "source_commit": "657ac0e5cf42c45b03b93a662fd8237b6b0be49f", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}], "schema_version": "paperlean-upstream-evidence-1", "source": {"author": "chessing234", "kind": "pr", "repository": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd", "title": "fix: Liouville Euler product factors", "url": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/pull/1660"}, "truth_status": "unverified_upstream_claim", "usable_as_scoring_label": false}
{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/31", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-2.json", "sha256": "2b4990cac121720f1b2489f96eac49d858e01979ceb72458191dccae5e646f7f"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Summary\n- Prop 3.2 relative `|ψ-x|/x`\n- Prop 4.3 paper lower bounds\n- Cor 5.5 gap length `x/(5000\\log^2 x)`\n- Thm 5.7 includes `-B₃`\n\nSupersedes #1643 #1645 #1649 #1651.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Compare Dusart 2018 statements\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)"}], "id": "pr-1670", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "6eab3a6e95cde52f2103bf7cda34ef204f4a530562b8601b5d2dc8d815021050", "project_id": "bounded-dusart-table-error-text-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Dusart.proposition_3_2", "source_commit": "57b0698f119db17fae2ee01a4e56651a9b96ea5c", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "4d933ed615bbdd809ed935fe9da18310f7163c41aaa54ba67d60b11d58153fd1", "project_id": "bounded-dusart-table-error-text-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Dusart.proposition_3_2", "source_commit": "57b0698f119db17fae2ee01a4e56651a9b96ea5c", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "e255c3c18011a7f05ca71e4a56a82b8b7375f86fa2102d62243388ab76f2f44e", "project_id": "bounded-dusart-psi-theta", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Dusart.proposition_4_3", "source_commit": "57b0698f119db17fae2ee01a4e56651a9b96ea5c", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "26da2b622e835275629b7b2108160509f55cc2bfd878c88853416f3ea4da083e", "project_id": "bounded-dusart-prime-interval", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Dusart.corollary_5_5", "s