{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/28", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-2.json", "sha256": "2b4990cac121720f1b2489f96eac49d858e01979ceb72458191dccae5e646f7f"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Summary\n- Trudgian Thm 2: `|π-li|`\n- JY Thm 1.4: `Eπ` exponent `1.801`; PT/JY π blueprints use `li`\n- PT ψ Table 1 constants; JY ψ exponent `1.515`\n\nSupersedes #1652 #1653 #1659 #1661 #1663.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Compare PT / JY / Trudgian papers for the cited theorems\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)"}], "id": "pr-1673", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "1760ae0c0e228cba8c10e23c31f61966dac6f870333a12e3813c96d7bf8c5ad4", "project_id": "bounded-jy-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "JY.theorem_1_4", "source_commit": "fc3f35017ee842bccf0d887980e8e22dda1583ab", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "5480389edc82225d6e107214860ddcb134bbd9df64f22267d665dc780faab510", "project_id": "bounded-jy-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "JY.theorem_1_4", "source_commit": "253828569c34a1b0e2f493bf92b4ec2513de2bab", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "f5ae1efa3eebe41984dfc44e542795f94ced74124b7a8f1c7e6b3205027149f7", "project_id": "bounded-trudgian-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Trudgian2016.theorem_2", "source_commit": "fc3f35017ee842bccf0d887980e8e22dda1583ab", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "b5f6f4b35ff98c4e6f739d09284e669e3fa91191e8eed007c6b0f0006fc34370", "project_id": "bounded-trudgian-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Trudgian2016.theorem_2", "source_commit": "253828569c34a1b0e2f493bf92b4ec2513de2bab", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}], "schema_version": "paperlean-upstream-evidence-1", "source": {"author": "chessing234", "kind": "pr", "repository": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd", "title": "fix: PT/JY/Trudgian secondary estimate statements", "url": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/pull/1673"}, "truth_status": "unverified_upstream_claim", "usable_as_scoring_label": false}
{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/96", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-1.json", "sha256": "782b308bb8fff52c06128aeeea0363799ee57b18137c136ee4dc29eeec646046"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Motivation\nStub statements still diverged from the source papers: Art01 `p_n` ranges/inequalities (Massias–Robin, Robin 1983, Dusart 1999), and FKS Prop. 3.11 / Cor. 3.12 mesh size plus the outer factor of 2.\n\n## Scope\n- `MassiasRobin.p_n_lower`: ranges on index `n`\n- `Robin.p_n_lower_const1`: require `n ≥ 2`\n- `Dusart1999.p_n_upper`: `n ≥ 39017` and `≤`\n- FKS `ε₄` / Prop. 3.11: `Fin (K+1)`, `λ = (T/t₀)^{1/K}`, last term inside the outer `2`\n- Goldbach blueprint `Δ`; TME–EMT errata note\n\nSupersedes #1701 and #1703. Refs #1698 #1699 #1700 #1702 #1705.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] CI green on predecessor PRs #1701 and #1703 (same diffs)\n- [x] CI green on this PR ([Build project](https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/actions/runs/30005348074))\n- [x] Diff checked vs Dusart 1999 / Massias–Robin / arXiv:2204.02588 Prop. 3.11–3.12\n\nMade with Cursor."}], "id": "pr-1706", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "7e03c17c9a7322c9efe2c86caef1462e8e3ae84231584d4193c945c22c4609fa", "project_id": "bounded-dusart1999-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Dusart1999.p_n_upper", "source_commit": "a93551347dce924b1db75d40218841bf085a465f", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "8af29a20d01cbb7b7703d85f522ca557eeef7be4578b6ce504781897796ec306", "project_id": "bounded-dusart1999-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Dusart1999.p_n_upper", "source_commit": "be5e07e04cde20c5ce